{title: O Dariyaa}
{artist: Arko Baar Baar Dekho}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] O dariya mujhe [Am] nahi jaana us paar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [G] Raanjha mera
O [G] dariya zara [Am] rokan do majhdhaar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [G] Raanjha mera
[G] O dariya mujhe [Am] nahi jaana us paar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [D] Raanjha mera
O [G] dariya zara [Am] rokan do majhdhaar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [G] Raanjha mera
[G] Tair ke aaya nadiya ve,        [Em] Pal pal jaise sadiya ve
[C] Ishq bada hai imteha [G] an tera,        [G] Chhaan li teri galiyaan ve
[Em] Dil mera na mileya ve,        [C] Mujhko bana le nigehb [G] aan tera
[G] O dariya hai [Am] tujhsa hi dildaar,        O [C] Ranjha mera, O [G] Ranjha mera
[G] O dariya hai wo [Am] hi mera ghar baar,        Jahan [C] Ranjha mera, jahan [G] Ranjha mera
[G] Haath na chhoote Raanjha ve,        [Em] Saath na toote Raanjha ve
[C] Mainu to bas deeda [G] ar tera,        [G] Laakh kaha na maana ve
[Em] Dil kaisa deewana ve,        [C] Kabse kare hai inteza [G] ar tera
[G] O Dariya zara [Am] thaam toh ja ik baar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [G] Raanjha mera
[G] O dariya mera [Am] Peer mera haqdaar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [G] Raanjha mera
[G] O dariya mujhe [Am] nahi jaana us paar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [D] Raanjha mera
O da [G] riya zara ro [Am] kan do majhdhaar,        Aaya [C] Raanjha mera, aaya [G] Raanjha mera
